Modifications by Mistpeach, 2026 (Apache-2.0 section 4(b)):

  - Ported the original motion engine and command parser to an ESP32-S3
    target that drives six servos directly via LEDC.
  - Replaced the original BLE transport and text protocol with a new
    single-connection, CRC16-framed protocol (V2), including a new host
    application protocol codec.
  - Removed Wi-Fi/UDP support and the legacy text protocol; added
    dual-serial logging and per-side (left/right) command routing.
  - Added a new PC host application (Python + PySide6 + bleak) with
    original-format CSV playback and optional mpv video sync.

